{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"react-integration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Integration"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Highlight has no React runtime dependency. The React entry only prepares a generic data shape for an application-owned code block component."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"create-component-props","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create component props"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createHighlightedCodeBlockProps } from '@tanstack/highlight/react'\nimport { highlighter } from './highlight'\n\nconst props = createHighlightedCodeBlockProps({\n  highlighter,\n  code: `const answer = 42`,\n  lang: 'ts',\n  title: 'answer.ts',\n  className: 'docs-code',\n})","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The result contains "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"copyText"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"htmlMarkup"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"lang"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"title"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tokens"},{"type":"text","value":", and the optional "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"className"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"application-component","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Application component"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import type { HighlightedCodeBlockProps } from '@tanstack/highlight/react'\n\nexport function CodeBlock({\n  className,\n  copyText,\n  htmlMarkup,\n  title,\n}: HighlightedCodeBlockProps) {\n  return (\n    <figure className={className}>\n      {title ? <figcaption>{title}</figcaption> : null}\n      <div dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: htmlMarkup }} />\n      <button type=\"button\" onClick={() => navigator.clipboard.writeText(copyText)}>\n        Copy\n      </button>\n    </figure>\n  )\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"htmlMarkup"},{"type":"text","value":" is escaped output produced by the library. Do not pass arbitrary user HTML through the same prop."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"run-the-component","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Run the component"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This complete example keeps the application component separate from highlighting and updates it as the source changes."}]},{"type":"component","name":"live-example","tagName":"md-live-example","attributes":{"id":"highlight-react-1"},"properties":{"data-example-group":"highlight-react","data-collapsed-indexes":"[]","data-workspace":"{\"version\":1,\"entry\":\"/src/main.tsx\",\"environment\":\"react\",\"files\":{\"/src/CodeBlock.tsx\":\"import { useState } from 'react'\\nimport type { HighlightedCodeBlockProps } from '@tanstack/highlight/react'\\n\\nexport function CodeBlock({\\n  className,\\n  copyText,\\n  htmlMarkup,\\n  title,\\n}: HighlightedCodeBlockProps) {\\n  const [copied, setCopied] = useState(false)\\n\\n  function copy() {\\n    setCopied(true)\\n    window.setTimeout(() => setCopied(false), 1200)\\n    void navigator.clipboard?.writeText(copyText).catch(() => undefined)\\n  }\\n\\n  return (\\n    <figure className={className}>\\n      <figcaption>\\n        <span>{title}</span>\\n        <button type=\\\"button\\\" onClick={copy}>\\n          {copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy'}\\n        </button>\\n      </figcaption>\\n      <div dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: htmlMarkup }} />\\n    </figure>\\n  )\\n}\",\"/src/main.tsx\":\"import { useState } from 'react'\\nimport { createHighlighter } from '@tanstack/highlight/core'\\nimport { ts } from '@tanstack/highlight/languages/ts'\\nimport { createHighlightedCodeBlockProps } from '@tanstack/highlight/react'\\nimport { createThemeCss } from '@tanstack/highlight/theme'\\nimport { githubDarkTheme } from '@tanstack/highlight/themes/github-dark'\\nimport { githubLightTheme } from '@tanstack/highlight/themes/github-light'\\nimport { CodeBlock } from './CodeBlock'\\nimport './styles.css'\\n\\nconst highlighter = createHighlighter({ languages: [ts] })\\nconst initialSource = [\\n  'type User = { name: string }',\\n  '',\\n  'export function greet(user: User) {',\\n  '  return `Hello, ${user.name}`',\\n  '}',\\n].join('\\\\n')\\n\\nconst themeCss = createThemeCss({\\n  light: githubLightTheme,\\n  dark: githubDarkTheme,\\n  darkSelector: '.dark',\\n})\\n\\nexport default function App() {\\n  const [source, setSource] = useState(initialSource)\\n  const props = createHighlightedCodeBlockProps({\\n    highlighter,\\n    code: source,\\n    lang: 'ts',\\n    title: 'greeting.ts',\\n    className: 'code-block',\\n  })\\n\\n  return (\\n    <>\\n      <style>{themeCss}</style>\\n      <main>\\n        <label htmlFor=\\\"source\\\">TypeScript source</label>\\n        <textarea\\n          id=\\\"source\\\"\\n          value={source}\\n          onChange={(event) => setSource(event.target.value)}\\n          spellCheck={false}\\n        />\\n        <CodeBlock {...props} />\\n      </main>\\n    </>\\n  )\\n}\",\"/src/styles.css\":\":root {\\n  font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui;\\n}\\n\\nbody {\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 24px;\\n}\\n\\nmain {\\n  display: grid;\\n  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);\\n  gap: 12px 16px;\\n}\\n\\nlabel {\\n  grid-column: 1;\\n  font-size: 13px;\\n  font-weight: 600;\\n}\\n\\ntextarea {\\n  grid-column: 1;\\n  min-height: 190px;\\n  box-sizing: border-box;\\n  padding: 14px;\\n  resize: vertical;\\n  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 16%, transparent);\\n  border-radius: 12px;\\n  background: var(--notebook-background);\\n  color: var(--notebook-foreground);\\n  font: 14px/1.6 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace;\\n}\\n\\n.code-block {\\n  grid-column: 2;\\n  grid-row: 1 / span 2;\\n  min-width: 0;\\n  margin: 0;\\n  overflow: hidden;\\n  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 16%, transparent);\\n  border-radius: 12px;\\n}\\n\\nfigcaption {\\n  display: flex;\\n  align-items: center;\\n  justify-content: space-between;\\n  padding: 8px 10px;\\n  font-size: 13px;\\n  font-weight: 600;\\n}\\n\\nbutton {\\n  padding: 5px 9px;\\n  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 18%, transparent);\\n  border-radius: 7px;\\n  background: transparent;\\n  color: inherit;\\n  cursor: pointer;\\n}\\n\\npre.th-code {\\n  min-height: 158px;\\n  margin: 0;\\n}\\n\\ncode {\\n  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace;\\n  font-size: 14px;\\n  line-height: 1.6;\\n}\\n\\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\\n  main {\\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\\n  }\\n\\n  label,\\n  textarea,\\n  .code-block {\\n    grid-column: 1;\\n    grid-row: auto;\\n  }\\n}\"}}"},"children":[{"type":"code","value":"import { useState } from 'react'\nimport type { HighlightedCodeBlockProps } from '@tanstack/highlight/react'\n\nexport function CodeBlock({\n  className,\n  copyText,\n  htmlMarkup,\n  title,\n}: HighlightedCodeBlockProps) {\n  const [copied, setCopied] = useState(false)\n\n  function copy() {\n    setCopied(true)\n    window.setTimeout(() => setCopied(false), 1200)\n    void navigator.clipboard?.writeText(copyText).catch(() => undefined)\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <figure className={className}>\n      <figcaption>\n        <span>{title}</span>\n        <button type=\"button\" onClick={copy}>\n          {copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy'}\n        </button>\n      </figcaption>\n      <div dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: htmlMarkup }} />\n    </figure>\n  )\n}","lang":"tsx","meta":"group=highlight-react file=/src/CodeBlock.tsx","title":"/src/CodeBlock.tsx","file":"/src/CodeBlock.tsx"},{"type":"code","value":"import { useState } from 'react'\nimport { createHighlighter } from '@tanstack/highlight/core'\nimport { ts } from '@tanstack/highlight/languages/ts'\nimport { createHighlightedCodeBlockProps } from '@tanstack/highlight/react'\nimport { createThemeCss } from '@tanstack/highlight/theme'\nimport { githubDarkTheme } from '@tanstack/highlight/themes/github-dark'\nimport { githubLightTheme } from '@tanstack/highlight/themes/github-light'\nimport { CodeBlock } from './CodeBlock'\nimport './styles.css'\n\nconst highlighter = createHighlighter({ languages: [ts] })\nconst initialSource = [\n  'type User = { name: string }',\n  '',\n  'export function greet(user: User) {',\n  '  return `Hello, ${user.name}`',\n  '}',\n].join('\\n')\n\nconst themeCss = createThemeCss({\n  light: githubLightTheme,\n  dark: githubDarkTheme,\n  darkSelector: '.dark',\n})\n\nexport default function App() {\n  const [source, setSource] = useState(initialSource)\n  const props = createHighlightedCodeBlockProps({\n    highlighter,\n    code: source,\n    lang: 'ts',\n    title: 'greeting.ts',\n    className: 'code-block',\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <>\n      <style>{themeCss}</style>\n      <main>\n        <label htmlFor=\"source\">TypeScript source</label>\n        <textarea\n          id=\"source\"\n          value={source}\n          onChange={(event) => setSource(event.target.value)}\n          spellCheck={false}\n        />\n        <CodeBlock {...props} />\n      </main>\n    </>\n  )\n}","lang":"tsx","meta":"group=highlight-react file=/src/main.tsx entry env=react","title":"/src/main.tsx","file":"/src/main.tsx"},{"type":"code","value":":root {\n  font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui;\n}\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 24px;\n}\n\nmain {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);\n  gap: 12px 16px;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  grid-column: 1;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\ntextarea {\n  grid-column: 1;\n  min-height: 190px;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  padding: 14px;\n  resize: vertical;\n  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 16%, transparent);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  background: var(--notebook-background);\n  color: var(--notebook-foreground);\n  font: 14px/1.6 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace;\n}\n\n.code-block {\n  grid-column: 2;\n  grid-row: 1 / span 2;\n  min-width: 0;\n  margin: 0;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 16%, transparent);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n}\n\nfigcaption {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  padding: 8px 10px;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  padding: 5px 9px;\n  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 18%, transparent);\n  border-radius: 7px;\n  background: transparent;\n  color: inherit;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\npre.th-code {\n  min-height: 158px;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\ncode {\n  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n  main {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n\n  label,\n  textarea,\n  .code-block {\n    grid-column: 1;\n    grid-row: auto;\n  }\n}","lang":"css","meta":"group=highlight-react file=/src/styles.css","title":"/src/styles.css","file":"/src/styles.css"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"ssr","children":[{"type":"text","value":"SSR"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Call "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createHighlightedCodeBlockProps()"},{"type":"text","value":" during server rendering. The returned markup is deterministic, so React can hydrate the surrounding component without rerunning highlighting."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"why-this-is-not-a-component-package","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Why this is not a component package"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Code blocks differ substantially across documentation systems: copy controls, filenames, tabs, collapsible sections, line callouts, and responsive behavior all belong to the application. The helper keeps highlighting generic instead of imposing TanStack-specific UI props."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"You can skip the React helper and call "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"highlighter.renderCodeBlockData()"},{"type":"text","value":" directly; they return the same core data plus "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"className"},{"type":"text","value":" handling."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"react-integration","text":"React Integration","level":1},{"id":"create-component-props","text":"Create component props","level":2},{"id":"application-component","text":"Application component","level":2},{"id":"run-the-component","text":"Run the component","level":2},{"id":"ssr","text":"SSR","level":2},{"id":"why-this-is-not-a-component-package","text":"Why this is not a component package","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# React Integration\n\nTanStack Highlight has no React runtime dependency. The React entry only prepares a generic data shape for an application-owned code block component.\n\n## Create component props\n\n```tsx\nimport { createHighlightedCodeBlockProps } from '@tanstack/highlight/react'\nimport { highlighter } from './highlight'\n\nconst props = createHighlightedCodeBlockProps({\n  highlighter,\n  code: `const answer = 42`,\n  lang: 'ts',\n  title: 'answer.ts',\n  className: 'docs-code',\n})\n```\n\nThe result contains `copyText`, `htmlMarkup`, `lang`, `title`, `tokens`, and the optional `className`.\n\n## Application component\n\n```tsx\nimport type { HighlightedCodeBlockProps } from '@tanstack/highlight/react'\n\nexport function CodeBlock({\n  className,\n  copyText,\n  htmlMarkup,\n  title,\n}: HighlightedCodeBlockProps) {\n  return (\n    <figure className={className}>\n      {title ? <figcaption>{title}</figcaption> : null}\n      <div dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: htmlMarkup }} />\n      <button type=\"button\" onClick={() => navigator.clipboard.writeText(copyText)}>\n        Copy\n      </button>\n    </figure>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n`htmlMarkup` is escaped output produced by the library. Do not pass arbitrary user HTML through the same prop.\n\n## Run the component\n\nThis complete example keeps the application component separate from highlighting and updates it as the source changes.\n\n```tsx group=highlight-react file=/src/CodeBlock.tsx\nimport { useState } from 'react'\nimport type { HighlightedCodeBlockProps } from '@tanstack/highlight/react'\n\nexport function CodeBlock({\n  className,\n  copyText,\n  htmlMarkup,\n  title,\n}: HighlightedCodeBlockProps) {\n  const [copied, setCopied] = useState(false)\n\n  function copy() {\n    setCopied(true)\n    window.setTimeout(() => setCopied(false), 1200)\n    void navigator.clipboard?.writeText(copyText).catch(() => undefined)\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <figure className={className}>\n      <figcaption>\n        <span>{title}</span>\n        <button type=\"button\" onClick={copy}>\n          {copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy'}\n        </button>\n      </figcaption>\n      <div dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: htmlMarkup }} />\n    </figure>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n```tsx group=highlight-react file=/src/main.tsx entry env=react\nimport { useState } from 'react'\nimport { createHighlighter } from '@tanstack/highlight/core'\nimport { ts } from '@tanstack/highlight/languages/ts'\nimport { createHighlightedCodeBlockProps } from '@tanstack/highlight/react'\nimport { createThemeCss } from '@tanstack/highlight/theme'\nimport { githubDarkTheme } from '@tanstack/highlight/themes/github-dark'\nimport { githubLightTheme } from '@tanstack/highlight/themes/github-light'\nimport { CodeBlock } from './CodeBlock'\nimport './styles.css'\n\nconst highlighter = createHighlighter({ languages: [ts] })\nconst initialSource = [\n  'type User = { name: string }',\n  '',\n  'export function greet(user: User) {',\n  '  return `Hello, ${user.name}`',\n  '}',\n].join('\\n')\n\nconst themeCss = createThemeCss({\n  light: githubLightTheme,\n  dark: githubDarkTheme,\n  darkSelector: '.dark',\n})\n\nexport default function App() {\n  const [source, setSource] = useState(initialSource)\n  const props = createHighlightedCodeBlockProps({\n    highlighter,\n    code: source,\n    lang: 'ts',\n    title: 'greeting.ts',\n    className: 'code-block',\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <>\n      <style>{themeCss}</style>\n      <main>\n        <label htmlFor=\"source\">TypeScript source</label>\n        <textarea\n          id=\"source\"\n          value={source}\n          onChange={(event) => setSource(event.target.value)}\n          spellCheck={false}\n        />\n        <CodeBlock {...props} />\n      </main>\n    </>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n```css group=highlight-react file=/src/styles.css\n:root {\n  font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui;\n}\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 24px;\n}\n\nmain {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);\n  gap: 12px 16px;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  grid-column: 1;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\ntextarea {\n  grid-column: 1;\n  min-height: 190px;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  padding: 14px;\n  resize: vertical;\n  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 16%, transparent);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  background: var(--notebook-background);\n  color: var(--notebook-foreground);\n  font: 14px/1.6 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace;\n}\n\n.code-block {\n  grid-column: 2;\n  grid-row: 1 / span 2;\n  min-width: 0;\n  margin: 0;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 16%, transparent);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n}\n\nfigcaption {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  padding: 8px 10px;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  padding: 5px 9px;\n  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 18%, transparent);\n  border-radius: 7px;\n  background: transparent;\n  color: inherit;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\npre.th-code {\n  min-height: 158px;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\ncode {\n  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n  main {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n\n  label,\n  textarea,\n  .code-block {\n    grid-column: 1;\n    grid-row: auto;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## SSR\n\nCall `createHighlightedCodeBlockProps()` during server rendering. The returned markup is deterministic, so React can hydrate the surrounding component without rerunning highlighting.\n\n## Why this is not a component package\n\nCode blocks differ substantially across documentation systems: copy controls, filenames, tabs, collapsible sections, line callouts, and responsive behavior all belong to the application. The helper keeps highlighting generic instead of imposing TanStack-specific UI props.\n\nYou can skip the React helper and call `highlighter.renderCodeBlockData()` directly; they return the same core data plus `className` handling.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: React Integration\n---\n\n# React Integration\n\nTanStack Highlight has no React runtime dependency. The React entry only prepares a generic data shape for an application-owned code block component.\n\n## Create component props\n\n```tsx\nimport { createHighlightedCodeBlockProps } from '@tanstack/highlight/react'\nimport { highlighter } from './highlight'\n\nconst props = createHighlightedCodeBlockProps({\n  highlighter,\n  code: `const answer = 42`,\n  lang: 'ts',\n  title: 'answer.ts',\n  className: 'docs-code',\n})\n```\n\nThe result contains `copyText`, `htmlMarkup`, `lang`, `title`, `tokens`, and the optional `className`.\n\n## Application component\n\n```tsx\nimport type { HighlightedCodeBlockProps } from '@tanstack/highlight/react'\n\nexport function CodeBlock({\n  className,\n  copyText,\n  htmlMarkup,\n  title,\n}: HighlightedCodeBlockProps) {\n  return (\n    <figure className={className}>\n      {title ? <figcaption>{title}</figcaption> : null}\n      <div dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: htmlMarkup }} />\n      <button type=\"button\" onClick={() => navigator.clipboard.writeText(copyText)}>\n        Copy\n      </button>\n    </figure>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n`htmlMarkup` is escaped output produced by the library. Do not pass arbitrary user HTML through the same prop.\n\n## Run the component\n\nThis complete example keeps the application component separate from highlighting and updates it as the source changes.\n\n```tsx group=highlight-react file=/src/CodeBlock.tsx\nimport { useState } from 'react'\nimport type { HighlightedCodeBlockProps } from '@tanstack/highlight/react'\n\nexport function CodeBlock({\n  className,\n  copyText,\n  htmlMarkup,\n  title,\n}: HighlightedCodeBlockProps) {\n  const [copied, setCopied] = useState(false)\n\n  function copy() {\n    setCopied(true)\n    window.setTimeout(() => setCopied(false), 1200)\n    void navigator.clipboard?.writeText(copyText).catch(() => undefined)\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <figure className={className}>\n      <figcaption>\n        <span>{title}</span>\n        <button type=\"button\" onClick={copy}>\n          {copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy'}\n        </button>\n      </figcaption>\n      <div dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: htmlMarkup }} />\n    </figure>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n```tsx group=highlight-react file=/src/main.tsx entry env=react\nimport { useState } from 'react'\nimport { createHighlighter } from '@tanstack/highlight/core'\nimport { ts } from '@tanstack/highlight/languages/ts'\nimport { createHighlightedCodeBlockProps } from '@tanstack/highlight/react'\nimport { createThemeCss } from '@tanstack/highlight/theme'\nimport { githubDarkTheme } from '@tanstack/highlight/themes/github-dark'\nimport { githubLightTheme } from '@tanstack/highlight/themes/github-light'\nimport { CodeBlock } from './CodeBlock'\nimport './styles.css'\n\nconst highlighter = createHighlighter({ languages: [ts] })\nconst initialSource = [\n  'type User = { name: string }',\n  '',\n  'export function greet(user: User) {',\n  '  return `Hello, ${user.name}`',\n  '}',\n].join('\\n')\n\nconst themeCss = createThemeCss({\n  light: githubLightTheme,\n  dark: githubDarkTheme,\n  darkSelector: '.dark',\n})\n\nexport default function App() {\n  const [source, setSource] = useState(initialSource)\n  const props = createHighlightedCodeBlockProps({\n    highlighter,\n    code: source,\n    lang: 'ts',\n    title: 'greeting.ts',\n    className: 'code-block',\n  })\n\n  return (\n    <>\n      <style>{themeCss}</style>\n      <main>\n        <label htmlFor=\"source\">TypeScript source</label>\n        <textarea\n          id=\"source\"\n          value={source}\n          onChange={(event) => setSource(event.target.value)}\n          spellCheck={false}\n        />\n        <CodeBlock {...props} />\n      </main>\n    </>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n```css group=highlight-react file=/src/styles.css\n:root {\n  font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui;\n}\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 24px;\n}\n\nmain {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);\n  gap: 12px 16px;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  grid-column: 1;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\ntextarea {\n  grid-column: 1;\n  min-height: 190px;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  padding: 14px;\n  resize: vertical;\n  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 16%, transparent);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  background: var(--notebook-background);\n  color: var(--notebook-foreground);\n  font: 14px/1.6 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace;\n}\n\n.code-block {\n  grid-column: 2;\n  grid-row: 1 / span 2;\n  min-width: 0;\n  margin: 0;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 16%, transparent);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n}\n\nfigcaption {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  padding: 8px 10px;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  padding: 5px 9px;\n  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 18%, transparent);\n  border-radius: 7px;\n  background: transparent;\n  color: inherit;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\npre.th-code {\n  min-height: 158px;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\ncode {\n  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n  main {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n\n  label,\n  textarea,\n  .code-block {\n    grid-column: 1;\n    grid-row: auto;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## SSR\n\nCall `createHighlightedCodeBlockProps()` during server rendering. The returned markup is deterministic, so React can hydrate the surrounding component without rerunning highlighting.\n\n## Why this is not a component package\n\nCode blocks differ substantially across documentation systems: copy controls, filenames, tabs, collapsible sections, line callouts, and responsive behavior all belong to the application. The helper keeps highlighting generic instead of imposing TanStack-specific UI props.\n\nYou can skip the React helper and call `highlighter.renderCodeBlockData()` directly; they return the same core data plus `className` handling.\n"}
